<http://data.silknow.org/object/350e7d7b-695d-3f48-8a68-3e9052476564/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Stevengraph picture woven in silk and mounted on card. Showing a scene from a rugby football match with one team about to score. The players are shown in caps and breeches, one team in blue shirts and the other in yellow, on a green-blue pitch. Both teams wear white breeches and black socks. On a beige mount inscribed 'The First Touch'. On the reverse is a trade label listing other Stevengraphs printed in 1881."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/350e7d7b-695d-3f48-8a68-3e9052476564> .

